#
# Generated documentation site artifacts (workspace DR-0010).
#
# The site is rendered from docs/ by caltechlibrary/workflows and published
# straight to GitHub Pages, so nothing in the repository regenerates these.
# Committing them is what let INSTALL.html go on serving the retired
# caltechlibrary.github.io install URLs after INSTALL.md had been corrected.
#
# Each rule below is anchored or directory-scoped deliberately. A bare
# pattern in this file matches at any depth, and these must not reach
# htdocs/ -- that is the application served from apps.library.caltech.edu,
# not documentation -- nor presentations/, whose two Slidy decks are built
# by hand and shipped verbatim by the docs workflow's include:.
#
# NOTE: comments here are on their own lines because git has no trailing
# comment syntax. `pagefind/  # search index` is one literal pattern that
# matches nothing, and it fails silently.

# Rendered pages. Root only: docs/ holds the sources, not output.
/*.html

# Assembled by the docs workflow, uploaded as a Pages artifact.
/_site/

# Pagefind search index, rebuilt by the index-site action on every run.
pagefind/
